{"n":"rmdir","s":{"en":"remove empty directories","es":"borra directorios VACÍOS"},"syn":"rmdir [OPTION]... DIRECTORY...","st":"gnu","tg":["delete"],"p":[{"n":"DIRECTORIO","es":"Directorio(s) vacío(s) a borrar.","en":"Empty director(ies) to delete.","v":1}],"o":[{"f":["-p","--parents"],"es":"Borra también los padres si quedan vacíos.","en":"Remove the parents too if they become empty."},{"f":["-v","--verbose"],"es":"Muestra cada directorio borrado.","en":"Print a message for each removed directory."},{"f":["--ignore-fail-on-non-empty"],"en":"ignore each failure to remove a non-empty directory"},{"f":["--help"],"en":"display this help and exit"},{"f":["--version"],"en":"output version information and exit"}]}